MORE(1)                                             ZX-UX

NAME
    more - show text one screen at a time

USE
    more file ...
    more < file

WHAT IT DOES
    more shows 22 lines, then waits at --More--.
    SPACE   show the next screen.
    ENTER   show one more line.
    q       quit.  EDIT and BREAK also quit.

    Keys come from /dev/tty, so the text may come from a file.
    With several files, each one starts with "::: name".
    Long lines wrap at 64 columns and count as several lines.
